{"kruDadruhersyasuyarTanan yan prati kopaH": [{"id": "kruDadruherzyA'sUyArTAnAM yaM prati kopaH", "headword": "क्रुधद्रुहेर्ष्याऽसूयार्थानां यं प्रति कोपः", "headword_slp1": "kruDadruherzyA'sUyArTAnAM yaM prati kopaH", "fold": "kruDadruhersyasuyarTanan yan prati kopaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "In the case of the verbs having the sense of क्रद्ध् 'to be angry', द्रुह् 'to injure', ईर्ष्या 'to envy', असूया 'to detract', the person against whom the feeling of anger etc. is directed is called सम्प्रदान।\n\nTerms: कारक-सम्प्रदान", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["क्रुधद्रुहेर्ष्याऽसूयार्थानां यं प्रति कोपः १.४.३७", "१.४.३७", "१.४.३७ क्रुधद्रुहेर्ष्याऽसूयार्थानां यं प्रति कोपः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kruDadruherzyA'sUyArTAnAM yaM prati kopaH १.४.३७", "१.४.३७", "१.४.३७ kruDadruherzyA'sUyArTAnAM yaM prati kopaH"]}], "kruDadruhorupasfswayoH karma": [{"id": "kruDadruhorupasfzwayoH karma", "headword": "क्रुधद्रुहोरुपसृष्टयोः कर्म", "headword_slp1": "kruDadruhorupasfzwayoH karma", "fold": "kruDadruhorupasfswayoH karma", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "But in the case of the verbs क्रुद्ध् and द्रुह् , when preceded by prepositions, the person against whom the feeling of anger etc. is directed is called कर्म कारक or object.\n\nTerms: कारक-सम्प्रदान", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["क्रुधद्रुहोरुपसृष्टयोः कर्म १.४.३८", "१.४.३८", "१.४.३८ क्रुधद्रुहोरुपसृष्टयोः कर्म"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kruDadruhorupasfzwayoH karma १.४.३८", "१.४.३८", "१.४.३८ kruDadruhorupasfzwayoH karma"]}], "kruDamaRqarTeByasca": [{"id": "kruDamaRqArTeByaSca", "headword": "क्रुधमण्डार्थेभ्यश्च", "headword_slp1": "kruDamaRqArTeByaSca", "fold": "kruDamaRqarTeByasca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "And after the verbs having the sense of क्रुध् 'to be angry' and मण्ड 'to adorn', the affix युच् is used. \n\nTerms: युच्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["क्रुधमण्डार्थेभ्यश्च ३.२.१५१", "३.२.१५१", "३.२.१५१ क्रुधमण्डार्थेभ्यश्च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kruDamaRqArTeByaSca ३.२.१५१", "३.२.१५१", "३.२.१५१ kruDamaRqArTeByaSca"]}]}